        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_159"/>
        <dc:title>JAGS: A Program for Analysis of Bayesian Graphical Models Using Gibbs Sampling</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>JAGS is a program for Bayesian Graphical modelling which aims for compatibility with classic BUGS. The program could eventually be developed as an R package. This article explains the motivations for this program, brieﬂy describes the architecture and then discusses some ideas for a vectorized form of the BUGS language.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2003</dc:date>
        <z:language>en</z:language>
        <z:libraryCatalog>Zotero</z:libraryCatalog>
    </bib:Article>
